    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#15$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're only a few hours away from the sunrise Miss Ines stipulated.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#15$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We need to hurry up the pace of our evacuation op.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Say, haven't you forgotten something even more important, Doctor of Rhodes Island?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "There's the airship too.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, we and Dublinn are starting from the same line again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Which means, time is of the essence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "To forever abide by commitments is not solely what we ask of ourselves... but of those we make deals with, too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've finally made it. I almost got offed by that Redsteel Guard boy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Her Grace is very dissatisfied with your indolence. Your methods are too tepid.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or is it that you're coaxing Alexandrina? Playing on her sympathies?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's a very grave accusation. I'm unconditionally loyal to Her Grace, that much is obvious, I'm just...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll review your excuses in hindsight. For now, though, there's no time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_bldwhoosh",
        "volume": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "......",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stay put, Rhodes Islanders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_spiritwhoosh"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 255,
        "b": 255,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.05,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you doing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Arts in black... Just as the fresh intel described.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've kept it very well hidden, Rhodes Island. To think this Cautus is the Sarkaz's very Lord of Fiends.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very interesting... Perhaps this <i>is</i> an issue that can't be solved without you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Poet, to not have recognized this is a further failure of your duties.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "By what means does Her Grace hope for me to remedy this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "While you were chatting with Dublinn, we've had the position of the airship's dock confirmed. It's... treacherous in there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "But our fresh intel tells us the 'Lord of Fiends' will have some way to handle it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, little Lord of Fiends, you'll cooperate with us, won't you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And what about that Windermere girl?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forget trying to make up for things. The technology of the airship is our number one priority.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "37_g1_glasgowboxinggym",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Think we've notified about everyone we could find.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And that... caps off all we can do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya isn't back yet, and neither the Doctor nor Ines have been in touch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like somewhere's caught fire outside again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's\u2014where the hotel is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'd better go take a look.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "*pant*... *pant*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Delphine? What are you sprinting like that for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Where's that Rhodes Island lot?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll lay this out straight. Listen up, Alexandrina Vina Victoria.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya and the Doctor got pushed by the 'Trilby Asher' into fulfilling that deal. They need to find the airship.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Duke Wellington's army is on this plate already. Afraid Duke Caster's reinforcements are here too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're all out to win the technology behind that Sarkaz airship. None of them will let their rivals have the advantage of getting it first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Norport's become the dukes' wrestling ring.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah. Surprising exactly no one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about that broadcast? You know, pushing the dukes into officially attacking this place\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Ines says she'll do all she can to make it happen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "To what? What are you telling us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "She says, she needs until sunrise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Got it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Assuming the dukes go with direct confrontation after all, how much time do we still have?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "As long as Miss Ines succeeds... the Duke of Windermere's high-speed warship should be approaching not long after the sun comes up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've got a hell of a lot of people gathered here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The people who aren't here probably already got the news. Anyone who does want to come with us'll keep with the procession.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So I suggest before the Duke's warship officially encroaches, we continue to wait here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "With the present circumstances... going out in the street's not a good idea.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doesn't matter if it's Wellington or Caster, they won't hold back against anyone they think's in the way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. We're best off leaving now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Sarkaz barracks around the barricade wall got ambushed. Odds are more than likely some duke's forces did it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "We should get as close as we can to the part of the wall that's thin on defenses, while it's still night.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "More importantly... we need to let them all know, everyone still peeping out from behind their windows, that what we said was true.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "This evacuation isn't some scheme to nab the last of their reserves. It's not some Sarkaz trap to wipe them out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reestablishing trust is a challenge, and the one and only way to do it\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is for them to see real action.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "21_G1_interrogat_room",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness02_intro",
        "key": "$darkness02_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_393_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here, the books you asked me for last time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I had to spend an age searching in those Londinium libraries, not even knowing Victorian. Grabbed some poor Feline in the end to find your stuff.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_393_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sometimes I see you writing and drawing in this blank book too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't just read, you write your own stuff too?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've never been to Kazdel, but I hear they've got a whole Sarkaz university underground there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you a teacher there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_393_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I'm just like you. Putting my life up for sale.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are these books really that fun to read?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_393_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "They all end fine enough, but similar events keep happening over and over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_393_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "All the authors can do is keep writing fine enough endings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_393_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I've gotten sick of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "General Manfred made us lock you in here, but hasn't given any further orders since...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "How did you offend him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_393_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe, he just thought jail would be more peaceful for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_393_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's easier in here... to do whatever I'd actually like to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And that's reading?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You really are a boring guy, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hear... us Sarkaz are going to get some real good news, real soon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So good it'll stun the entire land!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_393_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's just going to be another war.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Has anyone ever told you you're a drag to talk to?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_393_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Honestly, yeah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seriously... what a drag.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, I'm changing shifts. You behave in here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't forget, you promised to pay me for the books\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The Royal Court soldier's silhouette disappears with a wobble into the end of the prison corridor, and very soon, a different set of footsteps comes into earshot."
    },
    {
        "text": "Hoederer waits."
    },
    {
        "text": "But there is only quiet."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "37_g9_airshipdockcorridor",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The crew are all aboard the airship now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Paprika.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Urk... Here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you ever read a book called... <i>A History of Sarkaz War?</i>",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You should. I have a copy in my drawer. You can take it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is it a very fancy story?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is a history annals.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#14$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You said that already...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then you shouldn't be asking that sort of question.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I disapprove of near to every viewpoint expressed in it. The weakness, the grief, the crushing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But still, I recognize that it is a book whose pages are soaked in blood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "How would the writer describe the war we're seeing right now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm as curious as you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
